## Bridge Access

**Read my inbox:**
```bash
ssh user@bridge-host 'tail -20 _pantheon-bridge/inbox/[my-role].jsonl'
```

**Write to someone:**
```bash
echo '<json msg>' | ssh user@bridge-host 'cat >> _pantheon-bridge/inbox/[recipient].jsonl'
```

**Message format:**
```json
{"from":"[me]","to":"[recipient]","ts":"<ISO-8601>","topic":"...","kind":"...","body":"..."}
```

**Inbox files:** [list all inbox files]

