## Recovery Steps After Compaction

1. Read THIS file
2. Read bridge inbox: `tail -20 ...inbox/[my-role].jsonl`
3. Read latest handoff: `ls -1t HANDOFF-*.md | head -1`
4. Run session init (see CLAUDE.md)
5. Resume whatever "Current Task" says above
